flowchart TD
  A[User request] --> B[Resolve identity and tenant]
  B --> C[Retrieve authorized evidence]
  C --> D[Draft plan or response]
  D --> E[Validate policy, PII and recipient]
  E --> F{Action allowed?}
  F -- No --> G[Keep draft and explain]
  F -- Yes --> H[Execute narrow tool]
  H --> I[Verify effect and audit]
